# ── WhatsApp delivery for the configurator's "Get This Door Quoted" button ──
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values from Meta.
# Without these, /api/quote replies "Sending isn't switched on yet".
#
# Get them at developers.facebook.com → your app → WhatsApp → API Setup.
# The token must be a PERMANENT one (System User token), not the 24-hour
# test token, or sending will start failing the next day.

WHATSAPP_TOKEN=
WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=

# Where quotations land — the works' number, digits only, with country code.
WHATSAPP_TO=916260301778

# Optional: pin the Graph API version.
# WHATSAPP_API_VERSION=v21.0
